>BIFLS01744 hypothetical phage protein

>GLUAR02086 site-specific DNA-methyltransferase match to PF01555. This domain is found in DNA methylases. In prokaryotes, the major role of DNA methylation is to protect host DNA against degradation by restriction enzymes. This family contains both N-4 cytosine-specific DNA methylases (EC 2.1.1.113) and N-6 Adenine-specific DNA methylases (2.1.1.72)

